From: Tobkiri exact-window audit
Base: cua-driver-rs-v0.28.2 (fc188250b4ca8549b8e61f937fdb1fb560770e86)
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(cua-driver): align exact-target AX window sources

The observation walker accepts exact `_AXUIElementGetWindow` matches from the
application's AXChildren/AXWindows union, while the mutation gate samples only
AXWindows. Use the same source union in the gate. Identity still requires the
requested pid's live CGWindowID from WindowServer and an exact SPI-reported id;
there is no title, geometry, focus, or foreground fallback.

When distinct AX proxies for the same exact id disagree on minimized state, the
conflict remains explicit for the whole sample. A later duplicate cannot turn
that real conflict into an apparently known state.

